From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SteelMC contributors <noreply@steelmc.dev>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Allow asynchronous chunk status futures

Status implementations such as a remote NOISE importer must be able to
complete without blocking a Moonrise generation executor. A cancellation
that races a running status suppresses publication but deliberately keeps
chunk protections until the physical status future drains. The previous
incomplete-future warning described the old synchronous contract and is
removed with that contract.

diff --git a/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/task/ChunkUpgradeGenericStatusTask.java b/ca/spottedleaf/moonrise/patches/chunk_system/scheduling/task/ChunkUpgradeGenericStatusTask.java
